            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.0.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Bouncebin can now update itself. Choose <b>Bouncebin &#8594; Check for
      Updates&#8230;</b>, or let it look on its own. This is the last version
      you have to download by hand.</li>
  <li>Save a copy of your ratings from <b>Settings &#8594; Your ratings</b>:
      everything you have decided comes out as one small file you can keep or
      carry to another Mac.</li>
  <li>Repeat the song you are on with the <b>&#8635;</b> button, for when a
      bounce needs a few passes before you can call it.</li>
  <li>The detail panel follows whatever is playing, instead of staying on the
      song you opened it from.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
